@page "/"

@*
    Interactive, and deliberately not prerendered.

    A prerendered pass would build a session, connect it to the engine, render an empty console
    because nothing has arrived yet, and then throw the connection away when the request scope ends -
    and the circuit would open a second one a moment later. There is nothing worth prerendering here:
    the console has no content until it has talked to an engine.
*@

@rendermode @(new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false))

<AppShell />
